<title>INDIA: India t-bill auction devolvement at 649.1 mln-RBI.</title>
<headline>India t-bill auction devolvement at 649.1 mln-RBI.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) said an auction of 364-day treasury bills on Wednesday devolved on primary dealers to the extent of 649.1 million rupees.</p>
<p>The face value of the bills issued  amounted to 10.23 billion rupees.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
